Subject: [PATCH] clang, Plan 9: #pragma varargck as kencc checks it (9front's
 sys/src/cmd/cc/dpchk.c): argpos, type and flag pragmas, each call of an
 argpos function with a literal format checked conversion by conversion (l,
 ll, z, '*', x and X as o, void conversions such as %r and %%, void * for any
 pointer, an enum no wider than int as int); kencc's warnings in
 -Wplan9-format (part of -Wformat); test/Sema/plan9-varargck.c

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
